<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Native tests for DFLegacy.Ijl15.

  The tests were previously reachable only through build-native.ps1, which needs
  CMake. CMake is not installed on every machine that has to run them (measured
  2026-10-04: no cmake.exe anywhere in PATH or under the VS install, so
  build-native.ps1 stops at its first check while MSBuild and the x86 toolset are
  both present). This project makes the same test source buildable with the
  toolchain the release pipeline already uses, and DFLegacy.Emulator.slnx
  includes it, so the tests cannot silently stop running again.

  CMakeLists.txt still defines the CMake target: when CMake is available, either
  path builds the same file.
-->
